CAS number: 007446-09-5; 
Formula: SO2; 
UUID: 318ac0c2-4d15-3037-ad81-54135463a9b0
includes precursor secondary sulfur from refineries and infrastructure. No transports.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: is an assumption, very little data available
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_318ac0c2-4d15-3037-ad81-54135463a9b0.xml</text>
